ource src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/dc205734709b4a3b7cf51d1d4d30761c.webm?t=1754627527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.poster.avif?t=1754627527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.webm?t=1754627527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.mp4?t=1754627527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risimons can be caught to form a team ready for action! Defeat any of the opponents you encounter on your journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and catch</strong> those untamed creatures, embodiments of crazy, ludicrous or cynical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form </strong> a team worthy of the name, overcome trials and champions in their Gyms all over the region. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train </strong> your team, rise to the trickiest challenges the game offers.</p></li></ul>",
